      "id": "observability-006",
      "category": "foundations",
      "level": "进阶",
      "subtopic": "模型监控",
      "knowledgePoint": "SLI与SLO",
      "questionType": "比较与选型",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "服务监控中的 SLI 和 SLO 分别是什么？",
      "answer": "SLI 是服务水平的量化指标；SLO 是针对该指标设定的目标值。",
      "explanation": "指标、目标及统计时间窗口应一起定义。",
      "example": "请求成功率是 SLI，30 天内达到 99.9% 是对应 SLO。",
      "tags": [
        "SLI与SLO",
        "模型监控"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://sre.google/sre-book/service-level-objectives/"
